## 25. Security and Privacy [M]

Offline by default. No telemetry. Logs are rotated, structured, stored in `APP_HOME/logs`, and scrubbed of credentials. **Threat model** in `SECURITY.md` (local attacker, malicious data file, SQL injection, artifact tampering). SBOM (CycloneDX) and third-party license notices ship with the app. Dependency audit (`pip-audit`, `cargo-deny`) runs in CI.

